    "created_at": "2017-03-14T06:31:51Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-03-14T06:31:51Z",
    "body": "See also https://github.com/w3c/webcomponents/issues/404. This issue is not specific to `<ol><li>`.\r\n\r\nI don't think the current behavior of Blink is intentional one. I guess that we had implemented these without any clear idea or standards.\r\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
