    "body": "@domenic Of course. I was referring to usage of the `<li>` start tag without the corresponding `</li>` tag and the spec allowing for this. Adding more special tokens/behavior may solve some issues, but if backwards compatibility/inertia/2 decades of history was not a problem, I'd suspect a clean rewrite of the standard wouldn't behave this way.",
