    "body": "@domenic I can see why tag omission should be ok, but the rules for `<li>` seem to have been developed before custom elements existed. I don't know enough to know the __right__ solution. I would be curious what the spec would look like with more development. (I'm not involved with HTML6 or anything, but I guess now I'm interested.)",
