    "body": "> I can see why tag omission should be ok, but the rules for `<li>` seem to have been developed before custom elements existed.\r\n\r\nA little bit earlier, yes ^_^ - tag omission dates back to very early HTML, in the mid-90s, while custom elements are only a few years old, beginning around 2011 or so.",
